{"4951670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape From Lab", "steam_appid": 4951670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cutting-edge laboratory equipment to solve a series of challenging puzzles and escape from a laboratory that forces you to conduct research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle game set in a laboratory where research is mandatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices may lead to a surprising ending…</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hints are available if you get stuck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-difficulty puzzles that reward logical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Very little exploration is required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather information, organize the clues, and use logical reasoning to solve each puzzle. Please note that the game contains a significant amount of text.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Estimated Play Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15–60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Video Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream, record, and upload gameplay videos of this game. Monetized videos and livestreams are also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sound Effects</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sound Effect Lab</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cutting-edge laboratory equipment to solve a series of challenging puzzles and escape from a laboratory that forces you to conduct research!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a puzzle game set in a laboratory where research is mandatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices may lead to a surprising en